# ClearMint project

**Source of truth:** `PLAN.md` (scope, screens, JSON schemas, design, build order).

## Stack

- **Next.js** App Router + React + TypeScript + CSS
- API routes in `src/app/api/` (Plaid, Gemini)
- Screen components in `src/views/` (not `src/pages` — reserved by Next.js)
- Recharts; Gemini on user action only
- Demo JSON in `src/data/`; Plaid via API routes
- Secrets in `.env.local` at repo root — never commit

## Build approach

1. One screen at a time per PLAN build order.
2. Each screen on its own feature branch; merge when that slice works.
3. `npm run dev` — single dev server (no separate Express server).

## Data conventions

- Transaction amounts: **negative = spending**, **positive = income**
- Balances **hidden by default**; eye icon to reveal

## Design

- White bg, navy text; green income, red spending, blue savings
- Mobile-first, minimal; calm coach tone
